1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,923
Speaking, task two. Card number 4. You are at the station ticket office. You want to take a train to Brno. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:15,027
You are at the station ticket office. You want to take a train to Brno.

3
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:18,665
Good afternoon. How can I help you?

4
00:00:23,867 --> 00:00:26,933
Hello, when is the train to Brno?

5
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:29,890
The next train leaves at 10:15.

6
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,323
How much is the ticket?

7
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:40,133
The ticket costs 320 crowns.

8
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,467
Do I have to change trains?

9
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:49,367
No, the train is direct.

10
00:00:54,567 --> 00:00:57,428
Which platform does the train leave from?

11
00:00:57,633 --> 00:01:00,088
The train leaves from platform 3.

12
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:03,486
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,167
Have a good trip.

14
00:01:05,367 --> 00:01:15,159
Practise card 4 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
